          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.s081-f21-lecture-12-material",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 20
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "misconception": "kill 可以立即在另一核心上销毁目标进程。",
      "correction": "直接销毁可能碰到目标仍执行或持锁；xv6 设置标志并让目标在安全点自行退出。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.s081-f21-lecture-12-material",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 23
          }
